<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/28/msa@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Buku-buku rekod itu hendaklah—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/28/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/28/msa@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/28/msa@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/28/msa@> .
