<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/28/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/28/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/28/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Semua pegawai yang dilantik di bawah sub- seksyen (2) adalah tertakluk kepada kawalan, arahan dan pengawasan Ketua Pengarah."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/28/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/28/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/28/msa@/~part_II__cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/28/msa@> .
