<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/28/msa@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_1__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan cara semulajadi;"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/28/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/28/msa@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_1__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/28/msa@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/28/msa@> .
